---
Fix sample_browser path traversal bounds checking.

The sample browser may allow navigating outside intended directories
via ".." traversal. Add bounds checking to prevent access to
sensitive system files.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [x] Browser cannot navigate above a configured root directory
- [x] ".." at root level is a no-op (stays at root)
- [x] Symlinks that escape root are not followed (or are blocked)
- [x] Path buffer overflow prevented (check path length before concatenation)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Navigate to root, press "..", verify stays at root
- [ ] Attempt to construct path with many ".." components, verify blocked
- [ ] Verify path length limit enforced
- [ ] Test with symlink pointing outside root (if applicable)
